# An allowlist: the image is built from these paths and nothing else, so no
# run, no corpus text and no config.yaml (it holds an API key) is ever sent to
# a builder, local or remote.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!orrery/
!docker/config.docker.yaml
!docker/entrypoint.sh
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
